# Advanced photo merge.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Guhuza hakurikijwe uko ibintu bigaragara (harimo kuzunguruka)
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama y’uruziga rurerure
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Gukuraho amashusho asubiramo y’ibintu byimutse (ifoto ya mbere ni yo fatizo)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Uburebure bwa fokali (px) / ubugari bw’ishusho (px)
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Ishusho yahujwe hakurikijwe ubukarishye ikoresha masike z’inzego zishobora guhindurwa. Hitamo masike mu Nzego maze usige irangi kugira ngo uyinonosore.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Nta guhuza kwizewe kwabonetse. Koresha amafoto arimo ibisobanuro byinshi, ahurira ku gice kinini kandi yafatiwe ku mpande zitandukanye buhoro.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Amafoto y’inkomoko cyangwa igenamiterere ryo guhuza si byo.
